# The repository is LF. Without this, a Windows checkout can silently rewrite
# every file to CRLF at rest, which shows up as all 50-odd tracked files
# "modified" with an empty `git diff --ignore-cr-at-eol` -- and it broke
# tests/test_sw_cache.mjs, whose extraction regex anchors on a literal ";\n".
#
# This pins the policy going forward. Files already corrupted in a working
# tree are fixed separately with `git add --renormalize .`, committed on its
# own, which is worth doing when nobody else is mid-edit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch the vendored engine or the binary assets.
assets/vendor/** -text
*.task binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
